# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Internship Scout — environment variables
#
# Everything here is OPTIONAL for local development and for a first Vercel deploy.
# The app boots with zero configuration: it uses the free anonymous Pollinations
# tier for LLM evaluation, public job-board APIs for discovery, and a local JSON
# file for persistence.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Persistence ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Leave empty for local development: data is stored in ./.data/db.json
# On Vercel without a database the app falls back to /tmp (ephemeral, read-only
# filesystem) and shows a warning banner in the UI.
# Any Postgres works: Neon, Vercel Postgres, Supabase, local Postgres...
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:password@host/dbname?sslmode=require"
# POSTGRES_URL="postgresql://..."            # accepted as an alias (Vercel Postgres)
# DATA_FILE_PATH="./.data/db.json"           # override the local JSON store location

# ── LLM evaluation (Pollinations.ai) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Defaults target the free anonymous tier, which needs no key:
#   POLLINATIONS_BASE_URL=https://text.pollinations.ai/openai
#   POLLINATIONS_MODEL=openai
# If you have an API key (https://enter.pollinations.ai/keys) you can raise limits
# and use more models. Set the header-authenticated gateway instead:
#   POLLINATIONS_BASE_URL=https://gen.pollinations.ai/v1/chat/completions
#   POLLINATIONS_MODEL=openai
# Server-side only. Never expose this to the browser.
# POLLINATIONS_API_KEY="sk_..."
# POLLINATIONS_BASE_URL="https://text.pollinations.ai/openai"
# POLLINATIONS_MODEL="openai"
# AI_PROVIDER="pollinations"                 # or "heuristic" for fully offline runs

# ── Web search provider (optional) ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Gives the search console real open-web results. Server-side only.
# TAVILY_API_KEY="tvly-..."

# ── General ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SEED_DEMO_DATA="true"                      # seed demo records when the store is empty
# APP_CONTACT="internship-scout (you@example.com)"   # sent to providers that ask for a UA contact
